WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.633 --> 00:00:03.336
[music playing]

00:00:08.441 --> 00:00:11.344
- All right, the packages now.

00:00:11.411 --> 00:00:14.881
Whoo, there's supposed
to be a tire here. 

00:00:14.948 --> 00:00:15.882
- All right.

00:00:20.787 --> 00:00:23.623
- All the packages
seem to be the same.

00:00:23.690 --> 00:00:26.126
Based off my experience,
I believe it's

00:00:26.192 --> 00:00:28.561
meth, just from how it feels.

00:00:28.628 --> 00:00:29.729
It's crunchy.

00:00:29.796 --> 00:00:31.898
I don't have a smell.

00:00:31.965 --> 00:00:37.270
You can see the meth here,
so I got lucky this time.

00:00:39.839 --> 00:00:42.675
Next, I'm going to
move it into our SEC,

00:00:42.742 --> 00:00:46.012
which is our contraband
center, and get our drugs out.

00:00:46.079 --> 00:00:48.248
[door opens]

00:00:50.016 --> 00:00:51.618
[trunk opens]

00:00:52.986 --> 00:00:54.854
Drugs, count 1--

00:00:54.921 --> 00:00:58.425
[clattering]

00:01:00.693 --> 00:01:06.366
--27 28, 29, 30.

00:01:06.433 --> 00:01:08.201
30 sounds like a healthy number.

00:01:08.268 --> 00:01:10.437
So from this point, going to
take my drugs in, and then

00:01:10.503 --> 00:01:11.805
I'm going to get them tested.

00:01:11.871 --> 00:01:12.872
[trunk closes]

00:01:13.773 --> 00:01:14.808
[wheels rattling]

00:01:43.036 --> 00:01:44.170
All right.

00:01:48.908 --> 00:01:51.678
- And my weight?

00:01:51.744 --> 00:01:53.413
- Thank you.

00:01:53.480 --> 00:01:59.352
So got it all on there, 30
packages of methamphetamine,

00:01:59.419 --> 00:02:06.025
approximately 14.4 kilograms.

00:02:06.092 --> 00:02:09.295
Next, I'm going to get an agent
from HSI to take over the case,

00:02:09.362 --> 00:02:10.530
place the subject under arrest.

00:02:10.597 --> 00:02:12.265
And then the drugs
are ultimately

00:02:12.332 --> 00:02:15.335
going to be destroyed and
burned at one of our facilities.

00:02:26.913 --> 00:02:30.383
[music playing]

